Package: CooccurrenceRegression
Title: Bayesian Estimation of Co-Occurrence Affinity with Dyadic Regression
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: person("Arthur", "Newbury", email = "a.r.newbury@exeter.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R interface to the Julia package CooccurrenceRegression.jl. Estimates the
    affinity (log odds ratio of Fisher's noncentral hypergeometric distribution) of pairs of
    species from presence/absence data, and fits Bayesian regressions of co-occurrence on
    pairwise explanatory variables such as trait or phylogenetic distance.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: JuliaCall (>= 0.17.5), posterior, tools
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: Julia (>= 1.10)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
